<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25310" root="صيد" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَادٌ</span></b>  <i>A certain vein</i> (M, K) <i>between the eyes of
a camel,</i> (K,) or <i>between the eye and the nose;</i>
(M;) <i>whence the disease termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيَد</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْيَادٌ</span>
and pl. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصَايِدُ</span> [in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصائِدُ</span>]. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيَدٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْيَدُ</span>,
likewise in two places. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>Brass;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُفْرٌ</span>:

and <i>copper:</i> (S, M, K:) or <i>a species thereof:</i>
(K:) or <i>cooking-pots made of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُفْر</span>, (A'Obeyd,
TA,) or <i>of copper:</i> (A'Obeyd, M, TA:) pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صِيدَانٌ</span>, (M, TA,) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تِيجَانٌ</span> pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَاجٌ</span>: and
some say that ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَيْدَانٌ</span></b>  [q. v., thus written with
fet-h to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ص</span>,] signifies <i>copper.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See
also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صود</span>.

